Zi is a coding agent you can build with.

It runs in your repo. It keeps the work visible. It gives the model a small set of tools: read, bash, edit, write, and symbols.

Start with a prompt. Resume the thread later. Change the rules when your project needs different habits.

[Read the manual](https://withzi.dev/man/)
